{"time": 1753848141, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1954550553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "尽管阿蒂看上去并不会屈服于这种毫无逻辑的威胁，但或许是苏理绘身体里突然爆发出的惊世气势将其震慑，他犹豫着还是给你们让了行，并嘀咕道“查点资料需要那么小题大做吗……”"}
{"time": 1753848175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "967445798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "（[CQ:face,id=20,raw=&#91;object Object&#93;]还得是我们天才少女的气场）"}
{"time": 1753848228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1985982134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "随后打开了身后的门，拉了拉门后悬挂的铃铛——一位戴着厚厚圆框眼镜的瘦弱青年从阿蒂背后的地下室里跑上来。"}
{"time": 1753848243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144139535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "＊向苏理绘表达了感谢"}
{"time": 1753848260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "154356230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“罗斯，有客人要查阅报刊资料室！”"}
{"time": 1753848288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106904242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "青年看起来出了很多汗，又喘了几口气，点点头看向你们后招手让你们跟上，然后便自顾自地往回跑。"}
{"time": 1753848319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010305634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "*跟随"}
{"time": 1753848334, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1126926237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "*快步向前走，生怕阿蒂先生反悔，还没来得及和跑上来的人打招呼他便往回跑了，便快步跟上"}
{"time": 1753848353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "870301690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "你们被青年带领着走下了一段台阶，进入了一个布满灰尘的地下室，地下室里塞满了档案橱柜和摞得高高的旧报纸，还有其他各种各样的垃圾。整个房间闻着一股子霉味，而角落里的锅炉系统把地下室烘烤得十分闷热。"}
{"time": 1753848382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1350334505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "*吐槽“好热”"}
