{"time": 1754198578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900793933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "*跟随"}
{"time": 1754198613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810339615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "循着诺特先生给出的地址，你们前往马卡里奥家所在的街区"}
{"time": 1754198641, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1720903258", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "你们来到一片充斥着办公楼和商户的街区，能看到人流量并不算多，但仍有一位卖烟卷和报纸的年轻小贩坐在树荫里向四处的行人吆喝。\n“瞧一瞧看一看哎！上好的烟卷和刚发行的波士顿报！”"}
{"time": 1754198662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1635839811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": ".rh"}
{"time": 1754198662, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1635839811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[kp]试图在黑暗中窥见岁月史书"}
{"time": 1754198662, "type": "reply_private", "message_id": "1635839811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "在演奏厅中[kp]演奏出: 1D100=40"}
{"time": 1754198692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096352785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "看起来小贩先生注意到了人群之中有些突兀的你们，于是很热情地隔着一段距离就向你们吆喝他的商品“几位先生小姐！上好的烟卷、刚发行的报纸嘞！只要5美分一份的报纸！”"}
{"time": 1754198778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "72370353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "*走到小贩面前“来份报纸”"}
{"time": 1754198820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295339958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "*走上前去"}
{"time": 1754198827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1110339410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "＊也跟着走上去"}
{"time": 1754198928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "486767548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "你们向小贩走去，同时注意到街区尽头带有一块杂草丛生的前院的房子，那似乎就是这个街区唯一的私人住宅——马卡里奥家"}
{"time": 1754198959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "422524412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "这是一位年轻且普通的小贩：一身灰色而朴素的衣物、和着装一样普通的外貌，唯一有点特色的是他棕色翘起来的乱卷发和他那双看起来就有神而显得十分快乐的眼睛。"}
{"time": 1754198967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "755434055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "购买了他的商品后，你们看见年轻人露出了一个真诚而快乐的笑容，仿佛切实发生了什么好事。"}
{"time": 1754199039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1790335365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "他向你们挤挤眼睛“自我介绍一下——我是维特——波士顿最老实的商人、孩子们最好的玩伴、流言与八卦的忠实追随者、马戏团表演评论家、酒馆打牌的不败传说……———先生小姐们、谢谢惠顾！你们看起来好像在找什么……或者什么跑腿的小委托我也接的！”"}
{"time": 1754199083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632078510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（情报商啊！！）"}
{"time": 1754199088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1076170892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "2628755988"}, "sender": {"id": "2628755988", "name": "柒乔阪"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1790335365]（这里站不下那么多人）"}
{"time": 1754199135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2014285131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1076170892]（乐"}
{"time": 1754199207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1812515742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "*看向小贩，压低声音“你听说过波士顿可怕的房子的八卦吗？”"}
{"time": 1754199399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "136047039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "年轻人皱起了眉头，抬手压了压他那总是翘起来的棕色卷毛，随后了然地看向许司昤并压低声音：“说的是马卡里奥家吧！他们一家四口嘛，原先还蛮幸福的……但自从搬过来这边没多久，也不知是时运不济还是怎么了，又或者真像你说的“可怕的房子”？……唉唉！”"}
{"time": 1754199499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1374641192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“他们怎么了吗”"}
{"time": 1754199533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "435980638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "维特做着手势示意你们都靠近点：“接下来这些话可不要到处乱讲啊，我也是看在跟你们投缘才和你们讲的……少聊点别人家长里短是好！”"}
{"time": 1754199558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1405236206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "*向前一步，身体前倾，靠向小贩"}
{"time": 1754199569, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438194331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“马卡里奥先生吧，他和他的太太还有女儿们啊……”"}
{"time": 1754199579, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768175255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "＊掏出笔和笔记本准备记笔记"}
{"time": 1754199581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1746060140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=2F57874D9937ABBE408705645E383EF2.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhT-1BMLZw3cCo7_RDixD2RswYM92Bj2WSD_CiicrIzX9u2OAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhB5C1ONEnOuJ6oTELJM3Cl4egIeZQ&amp;rkey=CAISMHhGC2AXYEyRMGoPhuL54f_lYczs_uRk1uRBbkg3RT791h8xEorCRBZXnNKuk6a_jw,file_size=11510]"}
{"time": 1754199596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1887619589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“也就搬进去没几年的时间，嗯，就是说几个月前？马卡里奥先生就出了事……出事之后好像还得了那什么狂躁症？动不动就发狂、摔东西，甚至听说他还拖着骨折的身体从病床上爬起来殴打医生和家人呢！你们说这还是正常人类吗？！”"}
{"time": 1754199602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1106421301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1746060140]（好形象（"}
{"time": 1754199661, "type": "recv", "message_id": "666247499", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“骨折了都能起来，感觉不到疼痛吗？”"}
{"time": 1754199665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1098630759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "“这听起来像被什么东西附身了——至少在日本 这样的事情发生大家都会默认是被什么鬼怪附身了。”思考了一下说到。"}
{"time": 1754199710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "131941804", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=666247499]“所以才说不正常嘛！当然了，道听途说、道听途说……”"}
{"time": 1754199739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1823257793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1098630759]维特露出一个难看的笑容“鬼怪么……呵呵，或许是吧……”"}
{"time": 1754199749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010071097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "稍稍停顿，维特似乎又想到了什么：“但还不止这些，他还得了癔症！”"}
{"time": 1754199762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868463793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“成天念叨着什么，说什么、有个……有个什么来着？”"}
{"time": 1754199906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "755327756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "等待一会见还是没人跟上话头，维特便像是恨铁不成钢似的看着你们"}
{"time": 1754199921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1539059550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“是什么别卖关子了”"}
{"time": 1754199951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1949566747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "又叹口气——看向椎名绪“有个有着冒火眼睛的东西，他说那玩意成天骚扰他！还不止，他总是叫嚷着家里的床和衣柜什么的都想害他！你们听听，都病出幻觉来了！”"}
{"time": 1754199961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961770951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "*Õ_Õ"}
{"time": 1754200026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133399574", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“你们说、这会是你们口中的鬼怪吗……”"}
{"time": 1754200065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891170502", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "“听起来很像……”"}
{"time": 1754200068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "284176296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“说不准喏”*觉得好玩逗一逗"}
{"time": 1754200119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127250112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "*自我安慰到“这个世界没有鬼怪，都是人作怪”"}
{"time": 1754200140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1866485333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "维特很不中地看向苏理绘“不、不可能！肯定是病出幻觉了！世界上哪里会有鬼呢！应该、没有吧？……”"}
{"time": 1754200153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1908686575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（很不中）"}
{"time": 1754200171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904714803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "随后向着许司昤重重地点了下头"}
{"time": 1754200178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573361102", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1908686575]（懂我意思（"}
{"time": 1754200271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1871538589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“哦哦还不止，大概也就一个月前，又——怎么就成这样了呢？”小贩看着有些伤感，一时有些沉默，但很快又调整过来——"}
{"time": 1754200284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "982667420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“加布里埃尔太太也疯了……”"}
{"time": 1754200329, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1216310133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“加布里埃尔又是？”"}
{"time": 1754200332, "type": "recv", "message_id": "158665873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "“是马卡里奥的妻子吗？”"}
{"time": 1754200351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1583820570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "维特赞许地向许司昤点头"}
{"time": 1754200366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "538441409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“唉，加布里埃尔太太……多好的一位女士啊……时常照顾我的生意，还经常给我些小委托让我多赚点小费……”"}
{"time": 1754200383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869904244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "维特抓了抓头发，揉了下眼睛“我怎么会看不出她是在特意照顾我呢？……”"}
{"time": 1754200393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "4488197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "随着又咒骂了几句“这狗屁的世道，怎么就要这样对待那么好的人！他们那可怜的孩子啊……唉……”"}
{"time": 1754200425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1718595493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“孩子有没有影响？”"}
{"time": 1754200453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "590467948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "＊拍了拍维特的肩膀以示安慰"}
{"time": 1754200468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1261056432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "维特看了苏理绘一眼“那小女孩倒是没事，只是被他们家在塞勒姆的亲戚收养了而已。”"}
{"time": 1754200531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1234393992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=590467948]拍了拍维特之后，他似乎更沉浸了“多可爱一小孩啊，加布里埃尔太太又是那样善良……”维特看着更伤心了，或许他“孩子们最好的玩伴”的称号并不只是他的吹嘘。"}
{"time": 1754200650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "128602435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "*看向杂草丛生的院子“那现在马卡里奥家里是已经没有人住了吗？”"}
{"time": 1754200678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "382185903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "维特随着涌上心头的伤感而撇了撇嘴：“那是当然，现在啊，马卡里奥先生和加布里埃尔太太都被送到了罗克斯伯里疗养院治疗，那孩子也被他们在塞勒姆的亲戚收养了……不知道什么时候才能再听到那孩子的音乐呢……”"}
{"time": 1754200728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2095741767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "“孩子还会音乐呢，是什么乐器呢？还是歌唱？真好的孩子啊”"}
{"time": 1754200773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "121234240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“那孩子会弹吉他呢！弹的可好了！”"}
{"time": 1754200863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1227811402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“每次她弹吉他的时候，我们街区里的小孩们和我都会聚在她旁边，可开心了”"}
{"time": 1754200898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "553588754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "接着你们听见维特用极低的声音自语了几句"}
