{"time": 1754201135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "93811354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（抽卡什么时候运气好点）"}
{"time": 1754201170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1624953480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（这就是新手保护期吗）"}
{"time": 1754201193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1206543584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "许司昤和苏理绘在维特低语时听见了“就算是她那最好动的妹妹，也会在她弹奏时安静下来……”"}
{"time": 1754201231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "200591407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“她还有妹妹呢”"}
{"time": 1754201293, "type": "recv", "message_id": "263157820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "听见苏理绘的声音，维特骤然又抬起头盯着她、显得有些错愕“什么妹妹，马卡里奥家只有一个女儿啊？”"}
{"time": 1754201340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1575553440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（草）"}
{"time": 1754201343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175801973", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（吓人）"}
{"time": 1754201348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267132842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "“可你先前不是说，马卡里奥先生，他和他的太太还有女儿们，搬进去几年就出事了”"}
{"time": 1754201366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1331760454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "*表情凝重低声重复“女儿们”"}
{"time": 1754201377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "110998375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“我什么时候说过女儿们，你们听错了吧？我天天和那俩孩子一起玩，怎么可能记错呢！”\n维特越发错愕了，但同时他的神情似乎又展现出了一种……不可置信？"}
{"time": 1754201377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2098321761", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "“你们听到了他说什么？”＊戳了戳苏理绘"}
{"time": 1754201402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "291923233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“不对，不对，好像哪里不对劲？”"}
{"time": 1754201412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533411848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "你们看见维特突然狠狠地皱起眉头、张大嘴深呼吸着，看见他有些暴躁得握拳捶了下头、又抓着他那本就乱蓬蓬的棕卷发，继而他眼神里的光彩似是有些害怕而疑惑般地黯淡了——他似是寻求安慰般盯着你们——“不可能，他们家应该只有一个女孩啊，我怎么会忘呢？我怎么可能记错呢？！”"}
{"time": 1754201433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1574493157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2098321761][CQ:at,qq=3222503301] “说这家人的最好动女儿会安静的听另一位弹琴”"}
{"time": 1754201448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028569392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "（！！！Σ( ° △ °|||)︴）"}
{"time": 1754201499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904532898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1574493157]“嘶……那他现在说没有第二个女儿是怎么回事，事情越来越蹊跷了。”"}
{"time": 1754201541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1729203953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“他的反应好奇怪”"}
{"time": 1754201550, "type": "recv", "message_id": "731995448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "见你们迟迟不回答的小贩先生好像陷入了混乱，不断重复着“不对”、“不可能”等几个词……忽然他站起来，似是没想起自己摆在地上的商品般就跑了起来，也因此差点摔了一觉，但又马上调整回重心便跑了出去，留下他最后一句似有似无的疑惑。"}
{"time": 1754201557, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1026471880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "（要追吗（）"}
