{"time": 1754626590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954375458", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "“刚才我探望了先生，可他的状态非常不好，还一直念叨着恶魔之类的话”"}
