{"time": 1754712538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336370134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（那我还要再随机找人问咩）"}
{"time": 1754712539, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128249770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1237775207]“马卡里奥他……他一直被那个怪物记恨着……明明我们已经离开了他的房子啊……”"}
{"time": 1754712547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1500309207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=322061989]（在庭院.jpg）"}
{"time": 1754712629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "716840615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "*看向绪“那麻烦你去找一下她，和她同步一下信息吧，看看她那边有什么发现”"}
{"time": 1754712670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1117657497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "*看向夫人，皱了下眉头“记恨？这怪物与马卡利奥先生有过什么过节吗？”"}
{"time": 1754712704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1503577526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=716840615]＊点了点头，退出了病房"}
