{"time": 1754835774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "39052240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "你们进门后，莉莉丝很快为你们端来了甜点，听到苏理绘的话后，她显得吃惊而疑惑“什么妹妹？您在说什么？”并有些奇怪地盯着苏理绘"}
{"time": 1754835784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148734691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（草）"}
