{"time": 1754835822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "268661264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "（好像所有人都忘了妹妹）"}
{"time": 1754835860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783612033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“啊哈哈可能是我听错了，不过这些甜点看起来真美味”"}
{"time": 1754835876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "899710442", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "一旁的维克托品尝着布丁，似是好奇的盯着你们"}
{"time": 1754835892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2052017698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "一旁的维克托品尝着布丁，似是好奇地听着你们间的对话"}
{"time": 1754835899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "299296459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "*看向夫人“这孩子坐车坐懵了，她是想说夏莉妹妹住的很舒适”"}
{"time": 1754835973, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1960325135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "“夫人，您的厨艺真好，唉，夏莉妹妹呢，她不来吃吗？”"}
{"time": 1754836016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "862124524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=299296459]莉莉丝摇了摇头“不不不，其实在那孩子刚搬来我们家时，也一直在说自己有个妹妹之类的话，但我们一直以为她是精神受到什么刺激了......不过你们前来此地又提到夏莉曾经说过的话.....我想这应该不是巧合？”"}
{"time": 1754836077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "256863111", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“那很奇怪了，为什么你们都不知道她是否有个妹妹？”"}
{"time": 1754836090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1321809486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1960325135]“夏莉的在你们来之前已经端过去了，她正在房间里呢”"}
{"time": 1754836186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "832100451", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "“我们能去看看吗？”＊突然开口"}
{"time": 1754836220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1840072188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=256863111]莉莉丝有些皱着眉头，抚摸着手指”不是不知道，而是她根本就没有妹妹吧？自我哥哥他们一家生下夏莉，就一直都只有她一个女儿啊？“"}
