{"time": 1754838407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "611206212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（那个科比）"}
{"time": 1754838413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "673611076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "（科比特埋在那了）"}
{"time": 1754838424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "472400012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（哦科比特）"}
{"time": 1754838480, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1657278853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=323043460]“嗯……我不知道……它、它自称是科比特，有时候是一个冒着火的到处飞的骷髅头，有时候是镜子里的怪笑，有时候又是天花板渗出血组成的奇怪图案……”"}
{"time": 1754838487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1034238461", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=673611076]（地下室好像）"}
{"time": 1754838509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635849663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "（我有点不行了）"}
{"time": 1754838532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "94306632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（那个科比）"}
{"time": 1754838585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "29180613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "“你知道家里有地下室吗，有没有人去过”"}
{"time": 1754838599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "730720308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "*感到十分震惊，努力保持冷静，压住颤抖的声音“它对你的爸爸妈妈做了什么？”"}
{"time": 1754838640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "664497889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "这时夏莉希冀地看着维克托“哥哥，你真的很厉害吗，你能打败它吗？它、它很厉害的，它用床把爸爸丢出了窗外，我告诉大家可是大家都不相信……”"}
{"time": 1754838694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "154848360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（幻视出了肯德基肌肉爷爷的样子）"}
{"time": 1754838712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702746775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "维克托自信地在门外舞起了军刀，小夏莉的眼神也渐渐地更有神采了"}
{"time": 1754838722, "type": "recv", "message_id": "227789571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "（感觉能附在房子里的任何东西上，我们进去会很难打呀）"}
{"time": 1754838757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997851716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（戴一圈大蒜在脖子上）"}
{"time": 1754838762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "302909263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "（可以让这个NPC也跟我们一起进去打吗）"}
{"time": 1754838774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "953198269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=730720308]“爸爸在被丢出去后受了重伤，妈妈被折磨地好像也有些不正常了……”"}
{"time": 1754838804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "950681961", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "（小妹妹这么相信他，应该不是什么坏人吧）"}
{"time": 1754838853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "6144985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "“那你的妹妹呢？它把你的妹妹带去了哪里？要对她做什么？”"}
{"time": 1754838912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“妹妹？”夏莉的语气显得有些疑惑又不敢相信"}
{"time": 1754838923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1395777003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“我觉得，我应该是有一位妹妹的……”"}
{"time": 1754838948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400007657", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“我好像也记得一些相关的片段……可是，我记得，不太清楚？”"}
{"time": 1754838985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562113144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“它好像，很喜欢我们，妹妹，代替我？”"}
{"time": 1754839030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962465060", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3222503301"}, "sender": {"id": "3222503301", "name": "劇場愛歌"}, "message": "（可惜现在不是现代不然椎名绪可能就会看过一个神秘的乐队番并且猜夏莉是不是和某个绿色头发妹子一样有双重人格（不是）"}
{"time": 1754839054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335467557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“记忆里它威胁我不能说出去，不然就让我和妹妹永远分开……”"}
{"time": 1754839077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "391742890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3091099280"}, "sender": {"id": "3091099280", "name": "诶呀"}, "message": "（不会就是双重人格吧）"}
{"time": 1754839111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "992840568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3166982250"}, "sender": {"id": "3166982250", "name": "名取雅"}, "message": "（也不知道是那个鬼对她做了什么，让她变成这样，还是说她本身就是这样，然后被鬼发现了）"}
{"time": 1754839149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787740903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“啊哥哥姐姐们，你们那么厉害，我可以请你们救出我妹妹吗！我有很多很多玩偶、还有小镜子、还有一些零钱，啊还有我的吉他！”"}
{"time": 1754839163, "type": "recv", "message_id": "959841238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "“除了你们没人肯听我说这些了……”"}
{"time": 1754839187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549650448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "938830904", "user_id": "3362422751"}, "sender": {"id": "3362422751", "name": "Arcadia"}, "message": "夏莉的眼中似是要泛出泪花"}
